== What each service can reach, and how fast the page stops
OWN cloudflared
MOUNTS buzz_cloudflared_1
SETTINGS buzz_relay_1 false
CFCONTROL buzz_cloudflared_1
TSCONTROL buzz_tailscale_1
SETTINGS buzz_gateway_1 false
CFCONTROL buzz_web_1
SETTINGS buzz_web_1 true
TSCONTROL buzz_web_1
STOPPED 0
PASS  Cloudflare's sign-in and tunnel files are in a folder only its own service mounts
PASS  only the page writes the relay's settings, and each helper shares only its own folder with the page
PASS  the page, relay, pairing, Tailscale and gateway services run under an init process
PASS  the setup page stops in under 5 s
